<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Chesterfield I.D.A., Mo..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Chesterfield I.D.A., Mo..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stifel Nicolaus &amp; Co Inc said it received the written award for the $18.885 million of Chesterfield Industrial Development Authority, Mo., refunding and improvement revenue (St Andrews Episcopal-Presbyterian Project) Series 1997A, with a top yield of 6.515 percent in 2022.</p>
